sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor D as Driver
    participant APP as Mobile app (Expo)
    participant SEC as Secure storage (JWT)
    participant API as Backend /api/v1
    participant DB as Postgres (RLS)
    participant OBJ as Object storage (snapshots)

    D->>APP: Open "Find my car" tab
    APP->>SEC: read JWT (tenant_id, site scope, sub)
    alt token expired
        APP->>API: POST /auth/refresh
        API-->>APP: new JWT
        APP->>SEC: store new JWT
    end
    APP->>API: GET /vehicles/me/location (owner_user_id from JWT)
    API->>DB: SELECT vehicle WHERE owner_user_id = :sub AND tenant_id = :jwtTenant
    DB-->>API: current_slot_id, current_site_id, last_seen_at, snapshot_id
    API-->>APP: 200 OK {slot, site, lastSeenAt, snapshotId}
    APP->>API: GET /snapshots/{snapshotId}
    API->>OBJ: signed URL lookup
    OBJ-->>API: signed URL (short TTL)
    API-->>APP: snapshot URL
    APP-->>D: render slot pin on site map + snapshot thumbnail
    opt vehicle relocated since last check
        APP-->>D: banner "Xe đã được di chuyển sang ô {newSlot}"
    end
